Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Burlap Drinks the Basin
- Story & Context: Tracked during the November 2019 dock lockout at Pier 48, longshore crane operator Ray Tanaka set a pair of ribbon microphones by an open loading bay just as two idling supertankers blared two-second groans into the wet morning fog. Clara immediately matched their low-F pitch with an open-tuned acoustic crawl while Kenji bent his koto's fifth string against the paulownia wood, capturing the smell of diesel exhaust and low tide right onto four-track tape. Tanaka's hoarsely spoken chorus cut through the hiss with exhausted dockside grit: "Tie the hemp off double, we ain't moving till the steam clears."
